abstract: "Independent research on the DJI Cellular Dongle 2 IG831T, sanitized original-device evidence, and experimental offline bridge components. No physical bridge, DJI host acceptance or end-to-end 5G replacement is claimed. Documentation and kernel-derived materials have separately scoped licenses."
